settings-clipboard-history-mib = History Size
    .description = Most memory the clipboard history keeps, in MiB; the oldest entries are forgotten first

settings-clipboard-pinned-mib = Pinned Size
    .description = Most the pinned entries hold, in MiB; a pin past it is refused

settings-clipboard-persist = Keep History
    .description = Keep the clipboard history across restarts; selections marked secret are never kept
